ries and source ownership checks. A potential receiver near (14.4,12.5) is only a proposal, not verified suitable.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":\\\"Actual existing source residues only; any tool or additional material requirements remain unknown. Do not create inventory resources or reset the source.\\\",\\\"costs\\\":\\\"Method and costs may require development; specify learning costs, finite paid work, persistent progress and cancellation terms before execution.\\\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"Conserve moved matter at the checked receiver, retain partial physical changes, and report actual remaining source residue. Do not infer root eligibility, fertility, food production or wellbeing gains from transfer alone.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.energy\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":15}}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"The prior preparation has ended; no unfinished work needs resumption.\\\",\\\"No physical transfer is attempted by this request.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Prefer finite, reversible or limited-footprint trials with explicit material conservation.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"bounded-ground-preparation\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can a small loose-covered footprint be prepared by hand within the method's stated displacement limits?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Personal learning completed at tick 32.\\\",\\\"The trial at (14,12.5) ended at tick 40 after three paid rounds and 2.5 energy.\\\",\\\"Observed final cover mass is zero and residue mass is 0.04 within the original footprint.\\\",\\\"The completion event reports partial outcome and rootCompatible=false.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"No cultivation suitability or food benefit was established; residue still prevents the entire-footprint bare-ground requirement.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Conduct one bounded physical trial and record its actual limits and results.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Learned the method.\\\",\\\"Executed one bounded preparation trial.\\\",\\\"Recorded conservation of displaced cover as internal residue and the partial result.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"surface-38-moss-234\\\",\\\"Observed limitation: displacing cover inside the boundary does not clear the entire footprint.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"External residue removal and subsequent site compatibility have not been tested.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Use the observed limitation to frame a separate bounded transfer investigation.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The trial supplied direct evidence of the method's limit; no agricultural or wellbeing benefit was observed.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"moss-residue-transfer\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can Moss safely transfer the actual residue outside the prepared footprint using a bounded personally usable method?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"surface-38-moss-234 retains 0.04 residue at tick 40.\\\",\\\"The retrieved transfer description is bound to Lin and surface-21-lin-113; applicability to Moss's surface is not established.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Personal method availability, receiver feasibility, transfer outcome and later root compatibility remain unverified.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Obtain explicit usable terms and conduct a small conserved-material transfer trial if feasible.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Identified the residual material and the existing method's stated binding limitation.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Usable method terms, personal learning and paid physical feasibility and transfer trials.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Request a bounded method for this source; review its terms before learning or execution.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"None observed yet.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}}

